  "body": "Hi,\r\n \r\nIs there a way to remove the domain name in search for a user?\r\n\r\nWhen I search for a user in Element, I currently have to search for `@username:<matrix domain>` but would like to just use `@username`.\r\n\r\nI know it's possible to search for users on the local server but there is a need to also find users on remote federated servers with other Matrix domains.\r\n\r\nThanks ",
